nered with business leaders to develop and implement HR strategies. Led full-cycle recruitment, managed employee relations issues, and drove employee engagement initiatives. Proactively identified and resolved HR challenges, resulting in improved employee satisfaction and retention.\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"skills\": [\n        \"Recruitment\",\n        \"Employee Relations\",\n        \"Performance Management\",\n        \"Compensation & Benefits\",\n        \"HRIS\",\n        \"Conflict Resolution\",\n        \"Training & Development\"\n    ],\n    \"certifications\": [\n        \"SHRM-CP\",\n        \"PHR\"\n    ],\n    \"objective\": \"To leverage my HR expertise and passion for creating positive employee experiences in a challenging and rewarding role.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\",\n        \"Spanish\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-01-15\"\n}"}
