c.\",\n            \"duration\": \"2018 - 2023\",\n            \"description\": \"Led full-cycle recruitment, managed employee relations, and implemented initiatives that increased employee retention by 15%.\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"skills\": [\n        \"Recruitment\",\n        \"Employee Relations\",\n        \"Performance Management\",\n        \"Compensation & Benefits\",\n        \"HRIS\",\n        \"Conflict Resolution\"\n    ],\n    \"certifications\": [\n        \"SHRM-CP\",\n        \"PHR\"\n    ],\n    \"objective\": \"Seeking a challenging HR leadership role where I can leverage my expertise to build a thriving and positive company culture.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\",\n        \"Spanish\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-03-15\"\n}"}
