ership Development Program\",\n            \"description\": \"A comprehensive program designed to develop leadership skills in emerging leaders.\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"objective\": \"To leverage my expertise in HR to contribute to the growth and success of a dynamic organization.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\",\n        \"Spanish\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-03-15\"\n}"}
