tion programs, conducted employee surveys, and facilitated team-building activities to improve employee morale and engagement.\",\n    \"hr_software_experience\": [\n        \"Workday\",\n        \"SuccessFactors\",\n        \"BambooHR\"\n    ],\n    \"organizational_planning_skills\": \"Experienced in developing and implementing HR policies and procedures aligned with organizational goals.\",\n    \"conflict_resolution\": true,\n    \"training_programs_developed\": [\n        {\n            \"program_name\": \"Diversity & Inclusion Workshop\",\n            \"description\": \"A comprehensive workshop designed to promote diversity and inclusion in the workplace.\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"program_name\": \"Conflict Resolution Training\",\n            \"description\": \"A training program focused on equipping employees with effective conflict resolution skills.\"\n        }\n    ]\n}"}
