oyee Relations\",\n        \"Organizational Development\",\n        \"Performance Management\",\n        \"Diversity & Inclusion\"\n    ],\n    \"certifications\": [\n        \"SHRM-CP\",\n        \"PHR\"\n    ],\n    \"objective\": \"To leverage my HR expertise to contribute to a dynamic and growth-oriented organization.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\",\n        \"Spanish\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-03-15\"\n}"}
