mented HR policies and procedures to support organizational growth.\",\n    \"conflict_resolution\": true,\n    \"training_programs_developed\": [\n        {\n            \"program_name\": \"Leadership Development Program\",\n            \"description\": \"A six-month program designed to enhance leadership skills among managers.\",\n            \"target_audience\": \"Managers and supervisors\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"program_name\": \"Effective Communication Workshop\",\n            \"description\": \"A one-day workshop focused on improving communication skills in the workplace.\",\n            \"target_audience\": \"All employees\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-03-15\"\n}"}
