- Present\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"title\": \"HR Generalist\",\n            \"company\": \"Global Enterprises\",\n            \"duration\": \"2016 - 2018\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"skills\": [\n        \"Recruitment\",\n        \"Employee Relations\",\n        \"Performance Management\",\n        \"Training and Development\",\n        \"Conflict Resolution\",\n        \"HRIS Systems\",\n        \"Organizational Development\"\n    ],\n    \"certifications\": [\n        \"SHRM-CP\"\n    ],\n    \"objective\": \"To leverage my HR expertise to contribute to the growth and success of a dynamic organization.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\",\n        \"Spanish\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-03-15\"\n}"}
