ruitment\",\n        \"Employee Relations\",\n        \"Performance Management\",\n        \"Organizational Development\",\n        \"Workday\",\n        \"Conflict Resolution\"\n    ],\n    \"certifications\": [\n        \"SHRM-CP\"\n    ],\n    \"objective\": \"Seeking a challenging HR role where I can leverage my skills and experience to contribute to a thriving organizational culture.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\",\n        \"Spanish\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-03-15\"\n}"}
