ies and procedures aligned with business objectives.\",\n    \"conflict_resolution\": true,\n    \"training_programs_developed\": [\n        {\n            \"title\": \"Leadership Development Program\",\n            \"description\": \"A comprehensive program designed to develop leadership skills in emerging leaders.\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-03-01\"\n}"}
