es, job descriptions, and performance appraisal systems.\",\n    \"conflict_resolution\": true,\n    \"training_programs_developed\": [\n        {\n            \"title\": \"Leadership Development Program\",\n            \"description\": \"A six-month program designed to equip emerging leaders with the skills and knowledge needed to excel in their roles.\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\",\n        \"Spanish\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-03-15\"\n}"}
