ech Solutions Inc.\",\n            \"duration\": \"2018 - Present\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"skills\": [\n        \"Recruitment\",\n        \"Employee Relations\",\n        \"Organizational Development\",\n        \"Performance Management\",\n        \"HRIS\"\n    ],\n    \"certifications\": [\n        \"SHRM-CP\"\n    ],\n    \"objective\": \"To leverage my HR expertise to drive organizational success and foster a positive employee experience.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\",\n        \"Spanish\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-03-15\"\n}"}
