aged full-cycle recruitment for technical roles, developed employee engagement initiatives, and provided HR support to business leaders.\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"skills\": [\n        \"Recruitment\",\n        \"Employee Engagement\",\n        \"Performance Management\",\n        \"Conflict Resolution\",\n        \"HRIS\",\n        \"Technical Recruiting\"\n    ],\n    \"certifications\": [\n        \"SHRM-CP\",\n        \"Certified Conflict Resolution Professional\"\n    ],\n    \"objective\": \"To leverage my HR expertise to contribute to the success of a dynamic and innovative organization.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\",\n        \"Spanish\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-03-15\"\n}"}
