s\",\n        \"Performance Management\",\n        \"Compensation\",\n        \"Benefits Administration\",\n        \"Diversity and Inclusion\",\n        \"Training and Development\"\n    ],\n    \"certifications\": [\n        \"SHRM-CP\",\n        \"PHR\"\n    ],\n    \"objective\": \"To leverage my HR experience and skills to contribute to the success of a growing organization.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-03-15\"\n}"}
