es aligned with business objectives.\",\n    \"conflict_resolution\": true,\n    \"training_programs_developed\": [\n        {\n            \"program_name\": \"Diversity and Inclusion Training\",\n            \"description\": \"Developed and delivered a comprehensive training program on diversity, inclusion, and unconscious bias.\",\n            \"target_audience\": \"All employees\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"program_name\": \"Performance Management Training\",\n            \"description\": \"Created a training module on effective performance feedback and goal setting.\",\n            \"target_audience\": \"Managers\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\",\n        \"Spanish\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-03-15\"\n}"}
